Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.42,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}11{\fs68}日凌晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:21.25,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}印第安韦尔斯年终总决赛小组赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.54,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}首战失利后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:25.78,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}佩古拉怎样把出线希望争回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.43,0:00:45.92,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}开场连赢九分 {\fs78}30{\fs68}分钟拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:49.23,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}可今年前两次交手 佩古拉都输了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:51.84,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}第二盘 从底线相持到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.16,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}科斯秋克开始反扑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:11.53,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Beautifully dispatched.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮的一击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:52.43,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh! Majestic from Marta Kostyuk!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇！科斯秋克这一分太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:54.20,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:56.99,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}科斯秋克赢下底线长回合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:58.96,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}第二盘前{\fs78}4{\fs68}局连续互破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.52,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}两次领先被追回后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.81,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}佩古拉一度{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.62,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}她先保住自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:06.99,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}再去争对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:10.17,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:13.08,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}科斯秋克连续救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:16.11,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}第四次机会 她的双误送出破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.11,0:02:17.72,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}佩古拉{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:20.35,TL,,0,0,260,,{\an2}终于轮到自己把比赛拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:46.28,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first set was over quickly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘迅速结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:49.49,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The second was an arm-wrestle against Marta Kostyuk,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘却是一场拉锯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:52.38,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who made life very uncomfortable at times.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科斯秋克一度让她很难受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:57.23,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But the experienced American found a way,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她还是找到了解决办法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:59.28,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she so often does.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她经常能做到这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.58,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another Top 10 win for the season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N本赛季又一次击败前十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:07.92,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but more importantly her first right here in Indian Wells.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N更重要的是本届首胜到手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:11.03,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}她举起手 回应看台上的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.03,0:03:12.67,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}首战的失利过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.38,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}下一场对诺斯科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.55,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}她能把留住的机会变成晋级吗？
